      "Language": "ukr",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The mechanisms of the diabetes mellitus type II remission after bariatric operations were analyzed. The determinations of incretins and peculiarities of the incretins system functioning in patients, suffering diabetes mellitus type II and morbid obesity, were enlightened. The results of surgical treatment of patients, suffering morbid obesity and diabetes mellitus type II, were analyzed."},
